    "lines": [
      {
        "text": "Apps like Opus Clip charge $15 to $29 a",
        "startSec": 0.0,
        "endSec": 3.1
      },
      {
        "text": "month for this. We did it with free",
        "startSec": 3.1,
        "endSec": 5.5
      },
      {
        "text": "agent skills from Re Motion, which is",
        "startSec": 5.5,
        "endSec": 7.5
      },
      {
        "text": "free for individuals and small teams. Re",
        "startSec": 7.5,
        "endSec": 10.2
      },
      {
        "text": "Motion lets an AI  make videos",
        "startSec": 10.2,
        "endSec": 12.1
      },
      {
        "text": "the way it writes code. So the agent",
        "startSec": 12.1,
        "endSec": 14.4
      },
      {
        "text": "writes the edit, and Re Motion turns it",
        "startSec": 14.4,
        "endSec": 16.6
      },
      {
        "text": "into a real video file. And there's",
        "startSec": 16.6,
        "endSec": 18.6
      },
      {
        "text": "another free one called Hyper Frames",
        "startSec": 18.6,
        "endSec": 20.5
      },
      {
        "text": "from HeyGen that does the same job with",
        "startSec": 20.5,
        "endSec": 22.8
      },
      {
        "text": "web pages. So pick whichever your agent",
        "startSec": 22.8,
        "endSec": 25.2
      },
      {
        "text": "likes. First, our coding agent installed",
        "startSec": 25.2,
        "endSec": 28.0
      },
      {
        "text": "all 13 of Re Motion skills. Then the",
        "startSec": 28.0,
        "endSec": 30.9
      },
      {
        "text": "prompt was simple. Find the three best",
        "startSec": 30.9,
        "endSec": 33.4
      },
      {
        "text": "moments, cut each one under 45 seconds,",
        "startSec": 33.4,
        "endSec": 36.4
      },
      {
        "text": "make it vertical, and add captions word",
        "startSec": 36.4,
        "endSec": 39.0
      },
      {
        "text": "by word. And we gave it our latest",
        "startSec": 39.0,
