      },
      {
        "text": "the job app she needed.",
        "startSec": 5.29,
        "endSec": 7.09
      },
      {
        "text": "The crazy part, she got hired and he",
        "startSec": 7.09,
        "endSec": 9.39
      },
      {
        "text": "made it free for the whole world.",
        "startSec": 9.39,
        "endSec": 10.99
      },
      {
        "text": ">> Person who's paying tax is paying two",
        "startSec": 10.99,
        "endSec": 12.89
      },
      {
        "text": "times the GDP per capita.",
        "startSec": 12.89,
        "endSec": 15.29
      },
      {
        "text": "That is how much dependent India is on",
        "startSec": 15.29,
        "endSec": 17.69
      },
      {
        "text": "this 20%.",
        "startSec": 17.69,
        "endSec": 18.59
      },
      {
        "text": ">> Because one of them is my real voice and",
