        "endSec": 20.99
      },
      {
        "text": "one is a clone made on a laptop. Clip A",
        "startSec": 20.99,
        "endSec": 24.19
      },
      {
        "text": "was the clone and all it got was a 12",
        "startSec": 24.19,
        "endSec": 26.69
      },
      {
        "text": "second voice note. We typed one line,",
        "startSec": 26.69,
        "endSec": 29.19
      },
      {
        "text": "hit synthesize and it took under 10",
        "startSec": 29.19,
        "endSec": 31.39
      },
      {
        "text": "seconds to make it. This is Voice",
        "startSec": 31.39,
        "endSec": 33.79
      },
      {
        "text": "Studio. It's open source and it runs",
        "startSec": 33.79,
        "endSec": 35.89
      },
      {
