  {
    "id": "Short3-ArtCraft",
    "title": "Free Adobe Premiere & After Effects Alternative",
    "hookBadge": "CANCEL ADOBE (/mo) \u274c FILM CRAFT (zsh) \u2705",
    "startSec": 372.1,
    "endSec": 409.8,
    "durationSec": 37.7,
    "lines": [
      {
        "text": "five, this is Film Craft and it has a",
        "startSec": 0.0,
        "endSec": 2.69
      },
      {
        "text": "timeline, a program monitor, and an",
        "startSec": 2.69,
        "endSec": 5.0
      },
      {
        "text": "effects panel just like Premiere. And it",
        "startSec": 5.0,
        "endSec": 7.39
      },
      {
        "text": "costs zero.",
        "startSec": 7.39,
        "endSec": 9.0
      },
      {
        "text": "We opened the demo project, hit play,",
        "startSec": 9.0,
        "endSec": 11.19
      },
      {
        "text": "and it runs like the real thing. And",
        "startSec": 11.19,
        "endSec": 13.29
      },
      {
        "text": "it's just one of 16 apps from something",
        "startSec": 13.29,
        "endSec": 16.0
      },
      {
        "text": "called Art Craft. Each one stands in for",
        "startSec": 16.0,
        "endSec": 18.59
      },
      {
        "text": "an app you'd normally rent. Photo Craft",
        "startSec": 18.59,
        "endSec": 21.09
      },
      {
        "text": "is their Photoshop, Vector Craft is",
        "startSec": 21.09,
        "endSec": 23.19
      },
      {
        "text": "Illustrator, Light Craft is Lightroom,",
        "startSec": 23.19,
        "endSec": 25.69
      },
      {
        "text": "and PDF Craft is Acrobat. And this one,",
        "startSec": 25.69,
        "endSec": 28.69
      },
      {
        "text": "Effect Craft, is for motion graphics and",
        "startSec": 28.69,
        "endSec": 31.09
      },
      {
        "text": "visual effects. So, it's their After",
        "startSec": 31.09,
        "endSec": 33.09
      },
      {
        "text": "Effects. There are even apps for",
        "startSec": 33.09,
        "endSec": 35.0
      },
      {
        "text": "documents, spreadsheets, and slides. So,",
        "startSec": 35.0,
        "endSec": 37.69
      },
      {
        "text": "Word, Excel, and PowerPoint are covered",
        "startSec": 37.69,
        "endSec": 37.7
      }
    ],
